WEBVTT

00:07:28.896 --> 00:07:32.819
Now, I want to leave you with a tribute
to one of my mentors.

00:07:33.416 --> 00:07:38.995
She reminds me that physical
presence is important

00:07:39.019 --> 00:07:42.373
and that play is not a luxury,

00:07:42.397 --> 00:07:43.681
but a necessity.

00:07:50.746 --> 00:07:51.953
She's Pixie,

00:07:52.735 --> 00:07:55.133
and she's our family dog.

00:07:58.976 --> 00:08:00.746
And she loves to jump.